<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">tNotes on consolidated financial results:t t   n t t t   n1tThe above consolidated financial results have been reviewed and considered by the Audit Committee and subsequently approved by the Board of Directors at their respective meetings held on 13th August, 2019.  n t t t   n2tThe statutory auditors have conducted  limited review of the consolidated financial results of the Group for the  year ended 30th June, 2019.    n t t t   n3tPursuant to the share purchase agreement dated 25th June, 2018, the Company acquired further shares in Trion Chemicals Private Limited ( Trion ) and raised its shareholding to 59%. As per the Memorandum of Understanding entered between both the Companies, the voting rights and other operating powers were vested to the Company w.e.f. 1st July, 2018. Accordingly Trion has been considered as an Associate till 30th June, 2018 and a subsidiary thereafter and has been consolidated accordingly.  n t t t   n4tOn 1st April, 2019, the Group has adopted IND AS 116, Leases, using modified retrospective method. Accordingly, the comparative have not been retrospectively adjusted. The adoption of IND AS 116, did not have any material impact on the consolidated results for the Quarter ended 30th June, 2019.  n t t t   n5tFigures for the quarter ended 31st March, 2019 are the balancing figures between the audited figures in respect of the full year ended 31st March, 2019 and reviewed figures for the nine months ended 31st December, 2018.  n t t t   n6tIn line with Ind AS - 108 – “Operating Segments”, the operations of the Group fall under Chemical Business which is considered to be the only reportable business segment.  n t t t   n7tThe full financial results are also available on the stock exchanges' website i.e. www.bseindia.com and www.nseindia.com and on the Company’s website i.e. www.bodal.com  n  n</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
